    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marsh-meadow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι ἕλος κάτα βουκολέοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					20.221
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.483
			</span></i>: generally, <i>marshy ground</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν δόνακας καὶ ἕλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.474
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.191
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Cypr.</u>
				135.9
			</span></i> H. (<span class="entity">Idalium</span>), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.2.7
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>backwater</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάσκιον ἕ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1283
			</span></i>.</div>
